# Performance Highlights

Compared with:

* LS
* MCFS
* UDFS
* NDFS
* GLSPFS
* SPUFS

Key observations:

✔ Best Accuracy on six datasets

✔ Top-three performance across almost all datasets

✔ Significant NMI improvements on ALLAML and Colon datasets

✔ Robust performance across different domains

